The '''Ualaq''' were one of three [[Species|subspecies]] of the [[Aqualish]] from the [[planet]] [[Ando]].<ref name="HC2" /> [[Quaysail]], a [[New Republic pilot|pilot]] in the [[New Republic]]'s [[Hound Squadron]] was a Ualaq,<ref name="Alphabet Squadron">[[Alphabet Squadron (novel)|''Alphabet Squadron'']]</ref> as was [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]] member [[Po Nudo]].<ref name="BMF 56">{{BuildFalconCite|56|Starship Fact File}}</ref>

